{
  "id": "gear_reducing_formulas",
  "title": "Gear Reducing Formulas",
  "description": "Output torque, speed and horsepower with gears.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Gear Reducing Formulas\n\nCalculate output torque, speed, and horsepower for gear transmissions using the formulas below."
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Gear Output Torque",
        "Gear Output Speed",
        "Gear Output Horsepower"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "input_torque",
          "label": "Input Torque (Nm)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 500
        },
        {
          "id": "transmission_ratio",
          "label": "Transmission Ratio",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 3.8
        },
        {
          "id": "efficiency",
          "label": "Efficiency (%)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.9
        },
        {
          "id": "input_speed",
          "label": "Input Speed (rpm)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 2000
        },
        {
          "id": "input_power",
          "label": "Input Power (kW)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 300
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "output_torque",
          "label": "Output Torque (Nm)",
          "formula": "inputs.input_torque * inputs.transmission_ratio * inputs.efficiency",
          "unit": "Nm"
        },
        {
          "id": "output_speed",
          "label": "Output Speed (rpm)",
          "formula": "inputs.input_speed / inputs.transmission_ratio",
          "unit": "rpm"
        },
        {
          "id": "output_power",
          "label": "Output Power (kW)",
          "formula": "inputs.input_power * inputs.efficiency",
          "unit": "kW"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "### Formulas\n\n**Gear Output Torque:** Mo = Mi × r × μ\n\n**Gear Output Speed:** So = Si / r\n\n**Gear Output Horsepower:** Po = Pi × μ\n\nWhere:\n- Mo = output torque (Nm)\n- Mi = input torque (Nm)\n- r = gear transmission ratio\n- μ = gear efficiency\n- So = output speed (rpm)\n- Si = input speed (rpm)\n- Po = output horsepower (W, hp)\n- Pi = input horsepower (W, hp)"
    }
  ]
}